{"id":"en_christmas-catch-original","title":"Christmas Catch [Original]","titleEn":"Christmas Catch [Original]","description":"A detective finds herself drawn into an unexpected romance while pursuing a case during the holiday season. Emily Alatalo, known for her work on Workin' Moms, leads the cast alongside Andrew Bushell of Designated Survivor and Franco Lo Presti of Bad Blood. The film is directed by Justin G. Dyck, whose previous credits include A Very Country Christmas. Blending mystery with festive charm, the story follows the detective as professional duty and personal feelings become increasingly intertwined. Those interested in the series can follow it on Dramzio.","poster":"https://cdn2.nsstorage.space/christmas-catch-original/en_US/4fe59afea2519298/cover.webp","backdrop":"https://cdn2.nsstorage.space/christmas-catch-original/en_US/4fe59afea2519298/cover.webp","kind":"series","year":2025,"genres":["Short Drama","Drama"],"featured":false,"sources":[{"id":"rumble-0","label":"Rumble HD (Ad-Free)","url":"https://rumble.com/embed/v7dbnd8/?pub=4occak","kind":"embed","downloadable":false}],"episodes":[{"id":"ep_christmas-catch-original_1","title":"Episode 1","season":1,"number":1,"sources":[{"id":"rumble-0","label":"Rumble HD (Ad-Free)","url":"https://rumble.com/embed/v7dbnd8/?pub=4occak","kind":"embed","downloadable":false}]},{"id":"ep_christmas-catch-original_2","title":"Episode 2","season":1,"number":2,"sources":[{"id":"rumble-0","label":"Rumble HD (Ad-Free)","url":"https://rumble.com/embed/v7dbnd8/?pub=4occak","kind":"embed","downloadable":false}]},{"id":"ep_christmas-catch-original_3","title":"Episode 3","season":1,"number":3,"sources":[{"id":"rumble-0","label":"Rumble HD (Ad-Free)","url":"https://rumble.com/embed/v7dbnd8/?pub=4occak","kind":"embed","downloadable":false}]},{"id":"ep_christmas-catch-original_4","title":"Episode 4","season":1,"number":4,"sources":[{"id":"rumble-0","label":"Rumble HD (Ad-Free)","url":"https://rumble.com/embed/v7dbnd8/?pub=4occ